        47.76,
        96.50800000000001,
        270.2679999999999,
        132.5
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "title",
      "text": "and a tiny bacterium",
      "font": "Hand",
      "size": 44,
      "bounds": [
        49.3,
        142.608,
        367.112,
        181.46
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.0",
      "text": "Cells in a green leaf have a cell wall that",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        48.87,
        226.865,
        323.565,
        242.75
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.0",
      "text": "helps support and protect them, with a",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        49.38,
        249.06,
        319.11,
        264.435
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.0",
      "text": "cell membrane just inside it. Chloroplasts",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        48.78,
        271.06,
        336.33,
        286.63
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.0",
      "text": "use light energy to make sugars. A large",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        49.26,
        293.06,
        322.92,
        308.75
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.0",
      "text": "central vacuole stores water and",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        48.78,
        315.06,
        274.095,
        327.195
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.0",
      "text": "dissolved substances and helps maintain",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        48.795,
        337.06,
        332.93999999999994,
        352.435
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.0",
      "text": "the cell's shape. Plant cells have",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        48.405,
        359.06,
        271.44000000000005,
        374.435
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.0",
      "text": "mitochondria too.",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        49.38,
        381.06,
        173.71500000000003,
        393.195
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.1",
      "text": "Plant cells are not all alike. Root cells, for",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        49.515,
        418.865,
        333.25499999999994,
        433.85
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.1",
      "text": "example, usually have no chloroplasts.",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        48.78,
        441.06,
        317.3099999999999,
        456.51
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.1",
      "text": "The leaf cell in the illustration is only one",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        48.465,
        462.865,
        332.0849999999999,
        478.51
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.1",
      "text": "kind; it does not represent every cell in a",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        49.38,
        485.06,
        328.06500000000005,
        500.51
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.1",
      "text": "plant.",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        49.38,
        507.06,
        87.885,
        522.435
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.2",
      "text": "Now look at a bacterium. It is typically a",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        49.515,
        545.06,
        324.31500000000005,
        560.51
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.2",
      "text": "single cell and has no nucleus enclosed by",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        48.48,
        567.06,
        341.61,
        582.75
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.2",
      "text": "a nuclear membrane. Most of its DNA is",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        48.885,
        588.865,
        319.545,
        601.195
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.2",
      "text": "concentrated in a region called the",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        48.78,
        611.06,
        290.3250000000001,
        626.75
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.2",
      "text": "nucleoid. It still has a cell membrane,",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        49.38,
        633.06,
        306.585,
        647.85
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.2",
      "text": "cytoplasm and ribosomes, and it needs to",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        48.78,
        655.06,
        338.71500000000003,
        670.51
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "id": "paragraph.2",
      "text": "take in materials and use energy.",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        48.405,
        677.06,
        277.00500000000005,
        692.75
      ]
    },
